/*
  AIAutoTripNameSuggestion.strings
  TeslaSync — P4 shared surface · 0007 · AIAutoTripNameSuggestion (Apple)

  The P1/S10 i18n catalog contribution for this surface. The keys mirror the web source
  (components/ai/AIAutoTripNameSuggestion.tsx) verbatim — `trips.detail.aiSuggestName.*` — plus the
  shared AI-card keys the composed surface reads (`helix.*`, `ai.common.*` from AIFeatureCard /
  AiOutputPanel / AIThinkingIndicator) and the native P4 leaf chrome (idle / loading / freshness /
  retry), so the Swift sources hold no English literals. These entries fold into the app
  `Localizable.xcstrings` master catalog at integration time; they are kept in a per-surface table
  ("AIAutoTripNameSuggestion") so each parallel surface prompt owns its own strings.
*/

/* --- Feature card header (web source keys, verbatim) --- */
